$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Boggphi VI" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Foggy & Raining" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle one another on hilly broken ground.  The terrain is populated only by several stones and trees, the sole sources of cover.  Both teams have piled rocks into makeshift bases and flag bunkers. Each team must take the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touching it to their own flag to capture.  The first team with eight captures shall be the victor!";
